{
  "title": "Customer portal on Azure",
  "description": "Customer portal in the production Azure subscription. Customers sign in with Microsoft Entra ID and reach the portal through Front Door and an Application Gateway with WAF. The web App Service calls the API App Service, which keeps data in SQL Database, caches in Redis, reads secrets from Key Vault and sends telemetry to Application Insights. Orders are published to Service Bus and processed by a Functions app that writes exports to a storage account. App services sit in the app subnet and data stores in the data subnet of one virtual network.",
